# contacts-service

## Генерация proto (macOS)
```bash
python -m grpc_tools.protoc \
  -I=proto \
  --python_out=app/generated \
  --grpc_python_out=app/generated \
  proto/contacts.proto \
  proto/user.proto

sed -i '' 's/^import contacts_pb2/from . import contacts_pb2/' app/generated/contacts_pb2_grpc.py
sed -i '' 's/^import user_pb2/from . import user_pb2/' app/generated/user_pb2_grpc.py
```
